%% title: Dry-run of a release pull request
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CI as deploy job, dry-run
    participant S as estate-kit service
    participant K as API server
    participant GH as GitHub
    CI->>CI: build candidate images
    CI->>S: deploy, dry-run (GitHub OIDC token)
    S->>K: compose, apply dryRun=All
    K-->>S: accepted or rejected
    S-->>CI: diagnostics, render diff
    CI->>GH: annotations, check run, job summary
